# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# A linear type's arbitrary profile (IfcArbitraryClosedProfileDef): its
# outline kept as given, from the element's axis and not centred, as the
# one ring every view and the sweep read; negative coordinates kept to a
# tenth of a millimetre; a new outline replaces the old one whole; fewer
# than three points refused; an arbitrary kind without points drawn as the
# plain rectangle; the outline kept through the native file. The shape is a
# plain L for the geometry, not a frame section. The element's sweep, which
# the 3D view, the section and the IFC body are made from, is that outline
# times its length, closed.
import examples/bim-slice/bim_file.dl
import examples/bim-slice/bim_ifcx.dl
import examples/bim-slice/bim_ifcx_read.dl

function check outline case {boolean:condition} named {a string:label}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            print ((the string form of "FAIL: ") + label) as a line
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, 1)
        print ((the string form of "PASS: ") + label) as a line

# Whether `ringPoints` holds the points of `wanted`, in order, within 0.1 mm.
function ring {a pointer to a list:ringPoints} agrees with {a pointer to a list:wanted}:
    execute:
        if (the length of ringPoints) != (the length of wanted):
            return false
        loop cursor from 0 to the length of ringPoints:
            set have to the item at cursor in ringPoints
            set want to the item at cursor in wanted
            if ((the absolute value of (have's x - want's x)) > 0.0001) or ((the absolute value of (have's y - want's y)) > 0.0001):
                return false
        return true

# The first ring of linear type `typeId` in `modelValue`.
function the first ring of outline type {a 64 bit integer:typeId} in {bim model record:modelValue}:
    execute:
        set found to the bim linear type index of typeId in modelValue
        set ringList to the bim rings of linear type (the item at found's position in (modelValue's linearTypes's values)) in modelValue at 24 round corners
        return the item at 0 in ringList

set modelValue to an empty bim model
set target to the address of modelValue
set typeId to add bim linear type named (the string form of "Outline check") as role (bim generic linear role) sized 0.06 by 0.05 round false of (the string form of "wood") to target
set lShape to an empty list of a cad vector2
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to lShape
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.06 and y 0.0) to lShape
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.06 and y 0.02) to lShape
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.02 and y 0.02) to lShape
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.02 and y 0.05) to lShape
append (a cad vector2 with x (-0.0125) and y 0.0333) to lShape
check outline case (give bim linear type typeId outline lShape in target) named (the string form of "an outline of six points is given")
set found to the bim linear type index of typeId in modelValue
set shapeProfile to the bim profile of linear type (the item at found's position in (modelValue's linearTypes's values)) in modelValue
check outline case ((shapeProfile's kind = (bim arbitrary profile)) and ((the bim name of profile kind (shapeProfile's kind) round false) = (the string form of "IfcArbitraryClosedProfileDef"))) named (the string form of "its kind is IfcArbitraryClosedProfileDef")
check outline case (ring (the first ring of outline type typeId in modelValue) agrees with lShape) named (the string form of "its ring is the outline as given, not centred, a negative point kept")

# A beam of it 1 m long: its sweep is the outline's area (0.0024455 m2)
# times 1 m, closed.
set ground to add bim level named (the string form of "Ground") at 0.0 with height 3.0 to target
set beam to add bim linear typed typeId on ground from (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 1.0) to (a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 1.0) turned 0.0 to target
set beamValue to the item at (the bim linear index of beam in modelValue)'s position in (modelValue's linears's values)
set beamShape to the bim linear shape of beamValue in modelValue
check outline case (((the fast mesh flaw of beamShape) = 0) and ((the absolute value of ((the absolute value of (the bim volume of mesh beamShape)) - 0.0024455)) < 0.0000001)) named (the string form of "its sweep is the outline times the length, closed")

set smaller to an empty list of a cad vector2
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to smaller
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.04 and y 0.0) to smaller
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.04 and y 0.03) to smaller
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.03) to smaller
check outline case (give bim linear type typeId outline smaller in target) named (the string form of "a new outline of four points is given")
check outline case ((ring (the first ring of outline type typeId in modelValue) agrees with smaller) and (((the bim setting ((bim profile point setting) + 8) of typeId in modelValue)'s found) = false)) named (the string form of "it replaces the old one whole")

set tooFew to an empty list of a cad vector2
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to tooFew
append (a cad vector2 with x 0.04 and y 0.0) to tooFew
check outline case (((give bim linear type typeId outline tooFew in target) = false) and (ring (the first ring of outline type typeId in modelValue) agrees with smaller)) named (the string form of "fewer than three points are refused, the outline kept")

set reread to the bim model parsed from (the bim file text of modelValue)
check outline case (reread's valid and (ring (the first ring of outline type typeId in reread's modelValue) agrees with smaller)) named (the string form of "the outline is kept through the native file")
set native to the bim native text of ifcx (the bim ifcx text of modelValue identified as (the string form of "p.ifcx") for project (the string form of "p") by (the string form of "test") at (the string form of "2026-10-21T00:00:00Z"))
set fromIfcx to the bim model parsed from native's text
check outline case (fromIfcx's valid and (ring (the first ring of outline type typeId in fromIfcx's modelValue) agrees with smaller)) named (the string form of "and through IfcX")

set bareType to add bim linear type named (the string form of "No points") as role (bim generic linear role) sized 0.06 by 0.05 round false of (the string form of "wood") to target
set bim setting (bim profile kind setting) of bareType to ((bim arbitrary profile) as a 64 bit integer) keeping true in target
check outline case ((the length of (the first ring of outline type bareType in modelValue)) = 4) named (the string form of "an arbitrary kind without points is the plain rectangle")
